From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jason chien <3936511+jason5545@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 10:25:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] steamac: lay this fork's runner components over the FEX
 runner, add a vkd3d backend

The payload's optional steamac/ folder (staged by msfs2024-notproton's
tools/np-build/build-notproton.sh) is laid over the runner build it names
when the runner is patched, and verified with the rest of the patch:
our FEX (xtajit64.dll), advapi32, msvproc, CrossOver's libarm64ecfex.so
taken out, and the Vulkan loader in libMoltenVK.dylib's place with
CrossOver's MoltenVK kept in lib/aarch64/moltenvk as an ICD. Replaced
files are kept as .notproton-orig. The run script reruns wine.inf once
when the overlay changes so prefixes follow.

A new Graphics backend for FEX tools, vkd3d-proton + KosmicKrisp
(CX_GRAPHICS_BACKEND=vkd3d), copies the DXVK/vkd3d-proton DLLs from the
runner's lib/steamac/d3d into system32, adds their overrides and points
Vulkan at KosmicKrisp; every other FEX game keeps MoltenVK through the
loader. The updater is off so an official release cannot replace this
build.
